The defaults are the role entries listed in step 5 below. If that file already exists, read it and treat its `# budget:` line and its role entries as the current choices. Otherwise start from those defaults. A line whose role is not in step 5, such as `how explorer` or `why investigators`, is from a retired role. Drop it.

