=== entry f04a5e86cdcf
kind: translation
rules: setup-pstack, model-role
intent: Shows the file's shape without frontmatter, the `# defaults: 2` marker, or model names, then lists every role with its default from models.json. Keep the header comments' meaning and one line per role.
--- upstream
```
---
description: pstack per-role model choices (overrides skill defaults)
alwaysApply: true
---
# pstack model configuration. One line per role. Delete a line to fall back to the skill default.
# `inherit-parent` or `auto` as a value: the role runs on the parent chat model (omit Task `model`). Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.
# defaults: 2
# budget: large (xhigh)
feature, refactoring: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh
bug-fix: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh
perf-issue: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh
hillclimb: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh
judgment and prose: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh
hardest tasks: claude-fable-5-2-max
reflect tooling: claude-opus-5-5-high-fast
reflect judgment, divergent, synthesizer: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh
arena runners: claude-fable-5-2-high, claude-opus-5-5-high-fast, gemini-4-carbon-high
arena cross-judge pool: claude-fable-5-2-high, claude-opus-5-5-high-fast, gemini-4-carbon-high
swarm workers: claude-opus-5-5-high-fast
architect runners: claude-fable-5-2-high, claude-opus-5-5-high-fast, gemini-4-carbon-high
interrogate reviewers: claude-fable-5-2-high, claude-opus-5-5-high-fast, gemini-4-carbon-high
```
--- patched
```
# pstack model configuration. One line per role. Delete a line to fall back to the default.
# Entry: <provider>/<model> <effort>. `inherit-parent` runs the role on the parent's model (omit `target`). Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.
# budget: <label> (<effort>)
<role>: <entry>, <entry>, ...
```

The roles, in this order, with their defaults:

- `feature, refactoring`: {{model:feature, refactoring}}
- `bug-fix`: {{model:bug-fix}}
- `perf-issue`: {{model:perf-issue}}
